      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      571.59,
      298.2,
      667.66
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land depicted as Lot \u2018A\u2019 in extent of 0.0082 Hectare in the Advance Tracing No. KE/RMB/2024/75 dated 27.11.2024, prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of Parape in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 03B of Parape North in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Rambukkana in the District of Kegalle in Sabaragamuwa Province and bounded as follows:",
